   'set.material-note (hasheq 'zh "液态玻璃由系统合成（macOS 26 的 NSGlassEffectView；更早的系统用毛玻璃），窗口固定按暗色外观画。两种都透出窗口后面的桌面与别的窗口：「面板」是内缩的圆角面板，「整列」是侧栏整列。玻璃上的侧栏铺一层暗色：后面是白色时，次要文字的对比度实测 ≥ 4.5。设置页、调试面板打开时暂时不用玻璃。实测（窗口内容每帧都在动，每段 8 秒）：系统合成进程 CPU 不用玻璃 24–26%，用玻璃 26–31%；本程序的 CPU 不变" 'en "Liquid Glass is composited by the system (NSGlassEffectView on macOS 26; older systems get frosted glass); the window always uses the dark appearance. Both kinds show the desktop and other windows behind the window: \"panel\" is an inset rounded panel, \"full column\" is the whole sidebar column. A dark layer lies on the glass under the sidebar: with white behind it, secondary text measures at least 4.5:1. Glass is off while Settings or the debug panel is open. Measured (window content changing every frame, 8 s per run): window server CPU 24–26% without glass, 26–31% with glass; this app's CPU is unchanged")
