   'set.hix-note (hasheq 'zh "每台主机上家目录里的 git 仓库（隐藏目录、node_modules 跳过），每个仓库一份描述：中英双语的短关键词、关键句、别名、一句话总结（只按项目，不给每个文件生成）。描述由下面的模型写（缺省本机模型，内容不出这台 Mac），只在空闲时一个一个做，仓库变了（提交、README、清单文件）才重做。模型用 host_projects 查；云端模型缺省不能查（右键会话 → 项目索引 可打开）。改过的描述锁定，重新生成才会覆盖。" 'en "The git repositories under each host's home folder (hidden folders and node_modules skipped), one description per repository: short keywords and key sentences in English and Chinese, names, a one-line summary (per project, not per file). The model below writes them (a local model by default, so the content stays on this Mac), one at a time while nothing else runs, and again only when the repository changes (commits, README, manifest files). The model looks them up with host_projects; cloud models cannot by default (right-click a session → Project index to allow it). A description you edit is locked until you regenerate it.")
   'set.hix-status (hasheq 'zh "找到 ~a 个仓库 · 已描述 ~a · 待描述 ~a · 失败 ~a" 'en "~a repositories · ~a described · ~a waiting · ~a failed")
