   'set.mem-note (hasheq 'zh "从以前的会话里留下来的事实（偏好、项目约定、构建 / 测试命令、已知的坑）。每个会话开始时把它作用域链上的条目（全局 → 项目 → super-workspace → 工作区）注入系统提示词，合计 4 KiB，置顶的先；之后这个会话里不再变（改了从下一个会话起生效）。模型可以用 memory_search 查、用 memory_note 记。输入框里打「/remember 内容」立刻记一条（缺省记到当前工作区；「/remember global 内容」记到全局）。右键会话可以关掉它读 / 写记忆。" 'en "Facts kept from earlier sessions (preferences, project conventions, build / test commands, known pitfalls). When a session starts, the entries along its scope chain (global → project → super-workspace → workspace) go into the system prompt, 4 KiB in total, pinned first; they stay the same for the rest of that session (edits apply from the next session). The model can look them up with memory_search and save new ones with memory_note. Type “/remember …” in the input box to save one now (to the current workspace; “/remember global …” for every session). Right-click a session to turn its memory reading / writing off.")
   'set.mem-auto (hasheq 'zh "自动记忆：会话空闲 2 小时后，本机模型从里面提取值得记住的事实，与已有条目合并（用「项目索引」那个本机模型；你写的条目不会被改）" 'en "Automatic memory: when a session has been idle for 2 hours, the local model extracts facts worth keeping and merges them with the existing ones (same local model as the Project index; entries you wrote are never rewritten)")
