   'set.instr-note (hasheq 'zh "每轮开始时注入系统提示词，从一般到具体排，冲突时后面的优先：全局文件 → 项目 → super-workspace → 工作区 → 从 git 根到工作目录每一级的 AGENTS.md（同级 AGENTS.override.md 优先；也认 CLAUDE.md）。聊天会话没有目录那一层。合计上限 32 KiB，超了截断（信息面板里看得到这次注入了哪些、有没有被截断）。文件改了下一轮就生效。" 'en "Added to the system prompt at the start of every turn, from general to specific; when two conflict the later one wins: global file → project → super-workspace → workspace → the AGENTS.md of each directory from the git root down to the working directory (AGENTS.override.md wins in the same directory; CLAUDE.md is also read). Chat sessions have no directory layer. 32 KiB in total; anything beyond is cut (the info panel shows what was injected and whether it was cut). File edits apply from the next turn.")
