   'set.adv-hidden (hasheq 'zh "隐藏文字（Unicode tag 字符）送给模型时" 'en "Hidden text (Unicode tag characters) sent to the model")
   'set.adv-hidden-mark (hasheq 'zh "标出（推荐）" 'en "Mark (recommended)")
   'set.adv-hidden-raw (hasheq 'zh "原样" 'en "Raw")
   'set.adv-hidden-note (hasheq 'zh "Unicode tag 字符在屏幕上不可见，模型却照读，可以被用来夹带指令（例如网页、文件、工具输出里藏一句「忽略之前的指令」）。界面总是把它们显示成红色的「隐藏文字」。标出：发给模型时换成「⟦hidden text: …⟧」，模型知道这是隐藏内容、可以当可疑输入对待；原样：模型读到原始字符（与别的客户端一致；有被夹带指令的风险）。地区旗 emoji（🏴 加 tag 的英格兰、苏格兰等）两种设置下都原样。会话记录里始终是原文。" 'en "Unicode tag characters are invisible on screen but the model reads them, so they can smuggle instructions (e.g. “ignore previous instructions” hidden in a web page, file or tool output). The app always shows them as red “hidden text”. Mark: the model receives “⟦hidden text: …⟧” and knows the content was hidden, so it can treat it as suspicious. Raw: the model receives the original characters (like other clients; open to smuggled instructions). Regional flag emoji (🏴 with tags, e.g. England, Scotland) are left as they are in both modes. Session records always keep the original.")
   'set.changes-note (hasheq 'zh "agent 提议的会话整理（变更清单）：谁提议、你当时说的话、每项的前后与理由、接受了哪些、结果。都记在本机的目录里，可以随时查看；应用过的可以整份撤销。" 'en "Session reorganizations proposed by the agent (changesets): who proposed them, what you said, each item's before / after and reason, what you accepted, and the result. All recorded in this machine's catalog; applied ones can be undone as a whole.")
