   'set.chat-note     (hasheq 'zh "「💬 聊天」会话不用你选目录：每个聊天在这个根目录下有自己的目录，工具在里面跑。占用超过合计上限或磁盘空闲低于下限时，最久没用的聊天目录会被删掉（会话记录保留，里面记一条说明）；正在用的不删。每台主机各自一份。" 'en "\"💬 Chat\" sessions need no directory: each chat gets its own folder under this root, and tools run there. When the total exceeds the cap or free disk space drops below the floor, the least recently used chat folders are removed (the conversations stay, with a note); the open one is never removed. Each host has its own.")
